My only objection to the use of sivni is that sivni is private as in
private thoughts, but I don't really have a better alternative. "Private
property" isn't property kept hidden or in secret, it's merely something
owned by an individual (or sometimes a small group of individuals like in
the case of family-owned and timeshares). But as I said, I don't have any
good alternatives- I don't think pukypreposblo is better.

